  "description": "The meme relies on wordplay — specifically, a pun — to create humor. The phrase 'rare picture of a dishwasher at birth' is a play on the phrase 'rare picture of a baby at birth,' which is a common trope in photography. Understanding this type of humor requires knowledge of linguistic puns and how they are used in comedy.",
